      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "Independent RTX 5090 validation at head `f2988e1a91eded1bcf4c4349e45cdf093110dc8b` (Python 3.12.13, PyTorch 2.13.0+cu130): the upstream `TestTensorFragmentOptimizerStatePerGroup` passed all 6 ZeRO-1/2/3 × no-offload/CPU-offload cases. I also ran its state-value comparison with actual DP=2 for ZeRO-1 and ZeRO-2; both passed, and each group's full optimizer-state getter matched the PyTorch AdamW reference.\n\nThis exercises the multi-group state links on one and two GPUs. The runs used the PR's exact changed files and test over installed DeepSpeed 0.19.7; they do not cover DP=4 or a full exact-head checkout.\n",
